```mermaid
flowchart LR
    NAME[Input name] --> NORM[normalize: lower-case, de-accent, strip punctuation]
    NORM --> VAR[generate spelling variants]
    VAR --> SCORE[best fuzzy score vs each list entry]
    SCORE -->|score >= 0.75| HIT[hit: escalate to human]
    SCORE -->|score < 0.75| NOHIT[no hit]
    HIT --> QUEUE[human review queue]
```
